            "block_content": "For an employee on leave of absence who is enrolled in an HMO, the monthly Company contribution shall be up to $7.50. For an employee on leave of absence under the Family Medical Leave Act, the Company's contribution shall be continued at the employee's active level for the duration of the leave as required by law.",
